Package: ecmaster
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: khaiannguyen <nguyenkhaian2906@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6, python3, ethtool, iproute2, libcap2-bin, systemd
Recommends: linuxptp
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/khaiannguyen/ecmaster
Description: EtherCAT master on SOEM for Jetson Orin with PREEMPT_RT and Intel i226
 ecm_run drives EtherCAT slaves (CiA402 drives, DC SYNC0) from a dedicated
 RT core, with a remote diagnostics API (stats.json, ctl.sock), ecm_diag,
 the soft_bus virtual slave chain, systemd units (ecm_run@NAME,
 ecmaster-net@IFACE, ecmaster-clock@IFACE) and ecmaster-bootprofile.
 Installed in /opt/ecmaster. Nothing is enabled by the package:
 see /opt/ecmaster/share/doc/ecmaster/docs/systemd.md.
 Licence GPL-3.0-only; links SOEM v2.0.0 (GPLv3).
